cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this testbed or its measurements, please cite the paper below.
title: "FL-IDS wall-clock testbed: measuring synchronous and asynchronous federated aggregation on real processes"
abstract: >-
  Container-based testbed and complete raw measurements for a study of
  synchronous versus asynchronous federated-learning aggregation for intrusion
  detection, measured in wall-clock time on real processes and shaped networks.
  Includes the raw output of all 2858 runs, deliberately retaining the
  superseded batches measured with evaluation on the aggregator's critical
  path so the reported measurement effect can be verified independently.
